{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42217","headline":"闻查建州陷贼寄锺郎中 · 徐铉","name":"闻查建州陷贼寄锺郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻道将军轻壮图，螺江城下委犀渠。\n旌旗零落沉荒服，簪履萧条返故居。\n皓首应全苏武节，故人谁得李陵书。\n自怜放逐无长策，空使卢谌泪满裾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42217.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42217","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}